# ─── Runtime State & Databases ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runtime state a server accumulates: pushed submissions, teams' working
# folders, tournaments, and the accounts database. `defaultStorageDir()` in
# `packages/server/src/infra/cli.ts` puts all of it under the repository root
# when the server is run from anywhere inside a checkout, so these are anchored
# to the root with a leading slash.
#
# The slash is load-bearing, not tidiness. Written bare, a pattern like
# `league/` matches a directory of that name at *any* depth - and it did:
# `packages/server/src/league/` and `packages/server/tests/league/`, 27 files
# and 16,000 lines of the league, tournament, arena, practice and bench
# subsystem, were silently untracked from the monorepo restructure onwards, so
# a fresh clone could not build. Keep every one of these anchored, and think
# twice before adding a bare directory name to this file at all.
/data/
/submissions/
/workspaces/
/tournaments/
/league/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.sock

# ─── Probe Output & Temporary Scratch Files ───────────────────────────────────
# Trace logs, recorded sensor frames, and local credentials
scratch/*.jsonl
scratch/frames/
scratch/rotframes/
scratch/locframes.json
teams.local.json
*.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

